# Normalize line endings to LF in both the repository and the working tree so
# that a Windows checkout matches CI (Linux) byte for byte.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true checks the LF-stored fixtures out as CRLF
# while the code under test generates LF, so every byte-exact comparison fails
# locally but passes in CI. That cost 77 spurious test failures
# (TemplateGoldenTest, TemplateResourceLoaderTest) before this file existed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe requires CRLF. gradlew.bat is the only Windows script in the repo.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Never munge binaries.
*.png binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
